Description: GTK4 frontend for Tenstorrent AI media generation
 tt-local-generator is a GTK4 desktop application for generating AI videos,
 images, and generative art using Tenstorrent hardware (Wormhole / Blackhole).
 .
 Supports multiple inference backends:
  - Wan2.2-T2V-A14B -- text-to-video (QB2 / P300x2 or P150x4)
  - Wan2.2-Animate-14B -- character animation (video-to-video)
  - SkyReels-V2-DF-1.3B -- fast T2V on Blackhole (P150X4 / P300X2)
  - SkyReels-V2-I2V-14B -- image-to-video on Blackhole
  - Mochi-1 -- alternative video backend
  - FLUX.1-dev -- text-to-image
  - AnimateDiff (TTNN) -- animated GIF generation, Blackhole-only, no server
 .
 Key features:
  - Three-tier prompt generator (algorithmic, Markov chain, LLM via Qwen3-0.6B)
  - Unified Remix UI: remix any artifact into any other media type
  - Generative Art tab: SVG landscapes, ANSI art, constellations, palettes,
    verse, and more via an extensible plugin system (MCP-native)
  - TT-TV attractor mode: kiosk playlist display with auto-generation
  - Log viewer: Debug menu with browsable per-run logs and error highlighting
  - Context-aware menu bar: settings surface per active tab
 .
 Optional: fastapi + uvicorn for the MCP server (python3 app/mcp_server.py),
 which exposes all generators as MCP tools to Claude Code and other clients.
 .
 Requires: Docker CE, Tenstorrent firmware + kernel module (via tt-installer),
 and model weights downloaded from HuggingFace (see tt-model-* packages).

Package: tt-model-wan2-t2v
Architecture: all
Depends: tt-local-generator, debconf | debconf-2.0, python3-pip
Description: Wan2.2-T2V-A14B model weights (~118 GB) for tt-local-generator
 Downloads Wan-AI/Wan2.2-T2V-A14B-Diffusers from HuggingFace into
 ~/.cache/huggingface/hub/. Required for the Video generation tab.
 .
 The model is publicly available; a HuggingFace account is not required,
 though providing a token avoids API rate limits.

Package: tt-model-flux
Architecture: all
Depends: tt-local-generator, debconf | debconf-2.0, python3-pip
Description: FLUX.1-dev model weights (~34 GB) for tt-local-generator
 Downloads black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-dev from HuggingFace. Required for
 the Image generation tab.
 .
 FLUX.1-dev is a gated model — you must accept its license at
 https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-dev and provide a
 HuggingFace token with read access before installing this package.

Package: tt-model-mochi
Architecture: all
Depends: tt-local-generator, debconf | debconf-2.0, python3-pip
Description: Mochi-1-preview model weights (~20 GB) for tt-local-generator
 Downloads genmo/mochi-1-preview from HuggingFace. Required for the Mochi
 inference backend. The model is publicly available; a HuggingFace account
 is not required.

Package: tt-model-qwen3
Architecture: all
Depends: tt-local-generator, debconf | debconf-2.0, python3-pip
Description: Qwen3-0.6B model weights (~1.2 GB) for tt-local-generator
 Downloads Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B from HuggingFace. Required for the LLM prompt
 polish tier in the prompt-server. The model is fully public; no token
 or license acceptance is required.

Package: tt-model-animate
Architecture: all
Depends: tt-local-generator, debconf | debconf-2.0, python3-pip
Description: Wan2.2-Animate-14B model weights (~30 GB) for tt-local-generator
 Downloads Wan-AI/Wan2.2-Animate-14B-Diffusers from HuggingFace. Required
 for the character animation (video-to-video) mode in the Animate tab.
 .
 The model is publicly available; a HuggingFace token is optional (helps
 avoid API rate limits).

Package: tt-model-skyreels-t2v
Architecture: all
Depends: tt-local-generator, debconf | debconf-2.0, python3-pip
Description: SkyReels-V2-DF-1.3B-540P model weights (~12 GB) for tt-local-generator
 Downloads Skywork/SkyReels-V2-DF-1.3B-540P-Diffusers from HuggingFace.
 Required for the SkyReels T2V mode. Runs on Blackhole hardware only
 (P150X4 or P300X2). The model is publicly available; no token required.

Package: tt-model-skyreels-i2v
Architecture: all
Depends: tt-local-generator, tt-model-wan2-t2v, debconf | debconf-2.0, python3-pip
Description: SkyReels-V2-I2V-14B-540P model weights (~58 GB) for tt-local-generator
 Downloads Skywork/SkyReels-V2-I2V-14B-540P from HuggingFace. Required for
 the SkyReels image-to-video mode. Runs on Blackhole hardware only
 (P150X4 or P300X2).
 .
 This model uses the Wan2.2-T2V-A14B-Diffusers checkpoint for its VAE and
 T5 text encoder. The tt-model-wan2-t2v package is therefore a hard
 dependency and will be installed automatically if not already present.
 .
 The model is publicly available; a HuggingFace token is optional.

Package: tt-model-z-image
Architecture: all
Depends: tt-local-generator, debconf | debconf-2.0, python3-pip
Description: Z-Image-Turbo model weights for tt-local-generator
 Downloads Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo from HuggingFace. Required for the
 Z-Image-Turbo image generation mode (P300X2 hardware). Status: functional
 in tt-inference-server v0.17.0.
 .
 The model is publicly available; a HuggingFace account is not required,
 though providing a token avoids API rate limits.

Package: tt-model-motif
Architecture: all
Depends: tt-local-generator, debconf | debconf-2.0, python3-pip
Description: Motif-Image-6B-Preview model weights for tt-local-generator
 Downloads Motif-Technologies/Motif-Image-6B-Preview from HuggingFace.
 Required for the Motif image generation mode (P300X2 hardware, 2×2 mesh).
 Status: complete in tt-inference-server v0.17.0.
 .
 The model is publicly available; a HuggingFace account is not required,
 though providing a token avoids API rate limits.

Package: tt-local-generator-models-all
Architecture: all
Depends:
 tt-model-wan2-t2v,
 tt-model-flux,
 tt-model-mochi,
 tt-model-qwen3,
 tt-model-animate,
 tt-model-skyreels-t2v,
 tt-model-skyreels-i2v,
 tt-model-z-image,
 tt-model-motif
Description: Meta-package: all model weights for tt-local-generator
 Installs all model weight packages for tt-local-generator in a single
 command. This is a convenience package with no files of its own.
 .
 Total download size: ~360 GB. Only install this if you want every model.
 For a minimal setup, install tt-model-wan2-t2v and tt-model-qwen3 only.
